1900,9514100,5780100,9327900,39169000,34676000,26313300,9065500,7594700,19792100,21136400,8383000,3472000,5891000,2135000,2673100,6912600,2871400,10486100,85214100,51539000]}},"profile":{"website":"https://www.metronic-group.com","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","employees":null,"city":"Shah Alam","summary":"Metronic Global Berhad, an investment holding company, provides engineering and technology solutions in Malaysia and Internationally. It specializes in the design, supply, installation, testing and commissioning, service, and maintenance of integrated building management systems (IBMS), building management system (BMS), energy management system (EMS), integrated security management system (ISMS), information and communication technology system (ICT), extra low voltage system (ELV), integrated control and monitoring system (ICMS), and audio-visual system and information technology system (AVS). The company's security systems solutions cover card access, closed circuit TV system, guard tour, and car parking system. It also engages in the system integration of IBMS and integrated security management system (ISMS); e-project management (e-PM) of mechanical and electrical service; procurement of contracts in relation to engineering works, integrated security management system, and sale of engineering equipment; and property development. Metronic Global Berhad was founded in 1984 and is headquartered in Shah Alam, Malaysia.","zh":"Metronic Global Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，成立于1984年，总部位于马来西亚莎阿南，在马来西亚及国际范围内提供工程与技术解决方案。","lines":["综合楼宇管理系统：设计、供应、安装、测试与调试、服务及维护集成楼宇管理系统（IBMS）、楼宇管理系统（BMS）、能源管理系统（EMS）、集成安全管理系统（ISMS）、信息与通信技术系统（ICT）、超低压系统（ELV）、集成控制与监控系统（ICMS）以及音视频系统与信息技术系统（AVS）。","安全系统解决方案：提供门禁卡、闭路电视系统、巡更和停车场系统。","系统集成与项目管理：从事IBMS和ISMS的系统集成，以及机电服务的电子项目管理（e-PM）。","工程合同与设备销售：采购与工程工作、集成安全管理系统相关的合同，并销售工程设备。","房地产开发：从事房地产开发业务。"],"lines_en":["Integrated Building Management Systems: design, supply, installation, testing and commissioning, service, and maintenance of IBMS, BMS, EMS, ISMS, ICT, ELV, ICMS, and AVS.","Security Systems Solutions: card access, CCTV, guard tour, and car parking systems.","System Integration & Project Management: system integration of IBMS and ISMS, and e-project management (e-PM) of mechanical and electrical services.","Engineering Contracts & Equipment Sales: procurement of contracts related to engineering works and ISMS, and sale of engineering equipment.","Property Development: property development activities."]}}